# CSS Selectors Assignment Test Cases

# Total Marks: 50

TEST 1
Description: Check whether DOCTYPE declaration is present
Expected: <!DOCTYPE html>
Marks: 5

TEST 2
Description: Check whether main element and h1 heading are present
Expected: <main> and <h1>This Season's Speaker Lineup</h1>
Marks: 5

TEST 3
Description: Check whether universal selector is implemented
Expected: * { margin: .5em 1em; }
Marks: 5

TEST 4
Description: Check whether main element selector is implemented
Expected: main { border: 2px solid black; padding: 1em; }
Marks: 5

TEST 5
Description: Check whether h1 selector is implemented
Expected: h1 { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
Marks: 5

TEST 6
Description: Check whether p selector is implemented
Expected: p { margin-left: 3em; }
Marks: 5

TEST 7
Description: Check whether ID selector is implemented
Expected: #copyright { font-size: 80%; }
Marks: 5

TEST 8
Description: Check whether blue class selector is implemented
Expected: .blue { color: blue; }
Marks: 5

TEST 9
Description: Check whether right class selector is implemented
Expected: .right { text-align: right; }
Marks: 5

TEST 10
Description: Check required speaker names and class/id attributes
Expected:
Jeffrey Toobin
Andrew Ross Sorkin
class="blue"
id="copyright"
class="blue right"
Marks: 5

TOTAL MARKS: 50
